...@../../../dev/d2/themes/flow
# Core design only; source identities and proof receipts remain in Org.
title: WEAVER / WAL TO ANCHOR / QUALIFIED BALANCE {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
protocols: GO / ORIGINAL OUTCOME OBSERVATIONS {
  top: 0
  left: 0
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  mcp: SDK timeout and outcome readback\nSame application and reservation\nNo new credit from a missing reply {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  a2a: Original final usage and source binding\nUnknown execution keeps its hold\nNo authority from local log absence {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  acp: Cloud native owner recovery\nOld queued candidates stay fenced\nNo standalone balance write handle {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  goBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/go.svg
    top: 247
    left: 24
    width: 42
    height: 22
  }
  kubernetesBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/kubernetes.svg
    top: 247
    left: 82
    width: 28
    height: 28
  }
}
registry: SCHEME / SEMANTIC CONTRACT {
  top: 0
  left: 440
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  origin: Original financial commitment\nClaim / profile / account / reservation\nExact before-image and metered bound {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  alias: Cedar Code as Policy at final use\nCurrent source / owner / prefix\nCandidate acceptance is not settlement {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  query: Explicit evidence stages\nWAL / candidate / decision / activation\nUnknown never becomes zero cost {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
recovery: RUST / WAL AND COMMIT BROKER {
  top: 0
  left: 880
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  projection: Atomic local WAL frame and flush\nOriginal proposal and full after-image\nLocal durability releases no funds {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  join: Retain complete anchor candidate\nSurvive local WAL loss or truncation\nRecheck current final commit authority {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  fence: Independent protected account CAS\nOne application / reservation / delta\nLate result is the same original outcome {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
}
broker: RUST / CONFIRMATION AND PROJECTION {
  top: 0
  left: 1320
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  cas: Read current protected confirmation\nComplete commit body and prefix\nOwner and source generation bound {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  alias: Repair WAL and install exact image\nCommitted prefix from protected authority\nNo second delta during materialization {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  hold: Activate at the final authority gate\nCurrent head / full WAL / exact balance\nStale handles grant no authority {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  rustBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
    top: 40
    left: 156
    width: 34
    height: 34
  }
}
quint: QUINT\nLost replies / truncated WAL / late anchor decisions\nOld snapshots / stale confirmations / old workers {
  top: 810
  left: 220
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: policy
}
lean: LEAN\nActual account transition and source proof reuse\nCurrent projection / original hold / unique settlement {
  top: 810
  left: 960
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: semantic
}
protocols.mcp -> registry.origin
protocols.a2a -> registry.alias
protocols.acp -> registry.query
registry.origin -> recovery.projection
registry.alias -> recovery.join
registry.query -> recovery.fence { style.stroke-dash: 4 }
recovery.projection -> recovery.join
recovery.join -> recovery.fence
recovery.fence -> broker.cas
broker.cas -> broker.alias
broker.alias -> broker.hold
broker.hold -> broker.cas: Refresh the current protected head { style.stroke-dash: 4 }

